# .copyright-titles — one copyrighted title per line (case-insensitive grep patterns)
# Copy this file to .copyright-titles (gitignored) and add the titles of any
# copyright-protected works you use as local fixtures.
#
# Lines starting with # are comments. Blank lines are ignored.
# Patterns are passed to grep -i, so basic regex is supported.
#
# Example entries (do NOT add real titles here — put them in .copyright-titles):
#
# Some Film Title
# Another TV Show
# Anime Series Name
